   'What is the main focus of social forestry?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Industrial timber production."},{"id":"b","text":"Exclusively preserving wildlife habitats."},{"id":"c","text":"Community participation in forest management."},{"id":"d","text":"Only planting exotic species."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g00151', 'forest-governance', 'social-forestry-extension', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'Which Philippine law governs the establishment and management of the National Integrated Protected Areas System (NIPAS)?',
