   'What does ''reforestation'' mean in the context of social forestry?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Cutting down trees for timber production."},{"id":"b","text":"Replacing native species with exotic ones."},{"id":"c","text":"Clearing land for urban development."},{"id":"d","text":"Restoring tree cover in deforested or degraded areas."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
