   'What is the primary benefit of agroforestry in social forestry initiatives?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"It increases dependency on imported timber."},{"id":"b","text":"It promotes sustainable agriculture and forestry practices."},{"id":"c","text":"It focuses solely on cash crops."},{"id":"d","text":"It eliminates the need for community involvement."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g00159', 'forest-governance', 'social-forestry-extension', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'Which Republic Act strengthens the policy on environmental and natural resources management in protected areas and is also known as the Expanded NIPAS Act?',
