   'What is the primary objective of social forestry?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"To integrate trees with agricultural crops and livestock."},{"id":"b","text":"To increase industrial wood production."},{"id":"c","text":"To establish commercial timber plantations."},{"id":"d","text":"To promote sustainable forest management through community participation."}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
