   'In social forestry, what does ''community participation'' primarily involve?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Government agencies solely managing forest resources."},{"id":"b","text":"Private companies overseeing forest conservation efforts."},{"id":"c","text":"Local communities actively managing and benefiting from forest resources."},{"id":"d","text":"International organizations funding local projects."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
