  ('fg-g00163', 'forest-governance', 'social-forestry-extension', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'The term ''social forestry'' is often associated with which of the following practices?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Clear-cutting for timber production."},{"id":"b","text":"Establishing private timber corporations."},{"id":"c","text":"Integrating tree planting with community development."},{"id":"d","text":"Focusing exclusively on wildlife conservation."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
