   'What is a ''Community-Based Forest Management Agreement'' (CBFMA)?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"A contract granting private companies rights to manage forest areas."},{"id":"b","text":"A lease agreement for mineral extraction in forest lands."},{"id":"c","text":"An agreement where local communities are given rights to manage forest resources sustainably."},{"id":"d","text":"A government permit for logging operations."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
