   'Which Philippine law aims to provide tenurial security and improve the socio-economic conditions of upland farmers through social forestry?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Presidential Decree No. 705 (Revised Forestry Code)"},{"id":"b","text":"Republic Act No. 7586 (NIPAS Act)"},{"id":"c","text":"Republic Act No. 8371 (Indigenous Peoples'' Rights Act)"},{"id":"d","text":"Executive Order No. 263 (CBFM Strategy)"}]'::jsonb, 'd'),
  ('fg-g00173', 'forest-governance', 'social-forestry-extension', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'What does the term ''tenurial security'' refer to in social forestry programs?',
