  ('fg-g00292', 'forest-governance', 'forest-protection', 'Hard', 'practice',
   'Under PD 705, what authority does the Department of Environment and Natural Resources (DENR) have in forest protection pertaining to illegal logging activities?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"DENR has the authority to confiscate all logs, timber, and other forest products derived from illegal logging activities."},{"id":"b","text":"DENR can only issue warnings to illegal loggers but cannot confiscate logs."},{"id":"c","text":"DENR is responsible for prosecuting illegal loggers without coordination with other agencies."},{"id":"d","text":"DENR is authorized to sell confiscated logs in the open market."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g00293', 'forest-governance', 'forest-protection', 'Hard', 'practice',
   'Which provision of RA 11038, the Expanded National Integrated Protected Areas System Act, strengthens forest protection by addressing the issue of poaching and illegal wildlife trade within protected areas?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"RA 11038 imposes stiffer penalties for poaching and illegal wildlife trade within protected areas."},{"id":"b","text":"RA 11038 establishes a dedicated wildlife monitoring team for each protected area."},{"id":"c","text":"RA 11038 mandates the integration of indigenous knowledge in wildlife protection strategies."},{"id":"d","text":"RA 11038 requires the installation of surveillance equipment in every protected area."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g00294', 'forest-governance', 'forest-protection', 'Hard', 'practice',
   'Which of the following forest protection measures under CBFMA involves collaboration with local communities to enhance forest monitoring and patrolling?',
