  ('fg-g00397', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'As part of professional ethics, foresters are expected to show respect for which of the following?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Only their immediate supervisors."},{"id":"b","text":"Corporate executives."},{"id":"c","text":"All stakeholders and indigenous peoples."},{"id":"d","text":"Only government officials."}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g00398', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'Professional ethics in forestry include a commitment to which of the following?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Enhancing scientific knowledge and skills."},{"id":"b","text":"Exploiting forest resources for immediate gain."},{"id":"c","text":"Deforestation without replanting."},{"id":"d","text":"Ignoring public input on forestry projects."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g00399', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'According to professional ethics, when should a forester prioritize public safety?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Only when it does not conflict with economic benefits."},{"id":"b","text":"In all forestry activities and decisions."},{"id":"c","text":"Only during natural disasters."},{"id":"d","text":"When working with international organizations only."}]'::jsonb, 'b'),
  ('fg-g00400', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'What should a forester do if faced with a conflict of interest according to professional ethics?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Inform relevant parties and seek to resolve the conflict ethically."},{"id":"b","text":"Ignore it and continue working as normal."},{"id":"c","text":"Exploit the situation for personal gain."},{"id":"d","text":"Keep it confidential from all parties involved."}]'::jsonb, 'a'),
  ('fg-g00401', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'Which document outlines the ethical responsibilities and standards for Filipino foresters?',
