   'What is the focus of the Code of Conduct for Forestry Professionals in the Philippines?',
   '[{"id":"a","text":"Technical skills in tree identification"},{"id":"b","text":"Scientific research emphasis"},{"id":"c","text":"Ethical and professional behavior"},{"id":"d","text":"Financial management skills"}]'::jsonb, 'c'),
  ('fg-g00412', 'forest-governance', 'professional-ethics', 'Easy', 'practice',
   'Which value is highlighted as essential in the professional ethics for Filipino foresters?',
